k details that i  did was because i was scared that if i  told you you'd walk away from me the two  split and didn't see each other until  the after the final rose special which  hannah writes was quote as awkward as it  looked  i regret all this so much regret my  decisions  and i wish  you know it was different and i wish  that i could change the past but i can't  but my love for you i don't think it  will ever leave me it's just something  that  is there  to stay  during that same episode hannah asked  her runner-up tyler out for a drink  which brings us to bombshell number  three  my feelings weren't  like cut and dry like i still had  feelings for him  hannah and tyler had actually already  been chatting before the reunion special  with everything that happens  with with jed and you know the really  early signs that like things weren't  going great i think i always like kind  of was like ugh dang it like maybe i  made the wrong decision and didn't have  enough time a few weeks before after the  final rose i i asked if i could talk to  him and was very honest about  how i felt was wondering if he felt you  know  anything still i wouldn't have asked him  on  national television to go out if i  wasn't you know hadn't had previous  conversations before that but that was  our first time seeing each other in  person so there was still like a lot of  like i don't know what's going to happen  soon after after the final rose the  alabama native invited the model to her  apartment where they talked and kissed  and the next morning photographers  snapped pics of them saying goodbye two  days later tyler called hannah to  confirm that they were not exclusive and  the next morning pics of tyler out with  gigi hadid surfaced in her book hannah  says that cut her deep writing quote my  heart was on the line and he broke it  with a supermodel that was really hard i  think i was really embarrassed just like  my ego was like oh man this  this sucks so yeah that was really hard  