 he went on to date briefly before  calling it quits and while her love life  was full of drama hannah signed up for  dancing with the stars as a way to  combat the anxiety and depression she  was feeling  [Music]  which leads us to bombshell number five  hannah says those rumors that she and  her partner alan bersten were dating  couldn't have been further from the  truth writing that they quote had the  most volatile relationship of the season  by far we could be like love each other  hate each other in the next second like  we definitely communicate differently so  we we had a really hard time harder than  it looked on  you know on the show like we probably  were the most like openly would  would get an  arguments despite all that the two went  on to win the mirror ball trophy overall  like i wish him  the best and i know that he does for me  too but  i i think  it was important for me to show that  like not everything is how it seems and  like you don't really know  what's going on behind the scenes now  hannah says she just hopes that people  learn from her book that there are  lessons to be learned in the mess  there are going to be so many things in  life that you're going to be like how  did i get here how am i in  this  situation how i'm in this mess but  i think taking a moment to look back on  all those moments that you wondered why  to really  find what you've learned from that what  you gained  find that internal wisdom and message  you can find that from any  mess that you've had in your life if you  just take a moment to look at it from a  different perspective  [Music]  you
 

